// Title: Lazarus APT DLL Sideloading Activity
// Sigma ID: 24007168-a26b-4049-90d0-ce138e13a5cf
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: Thurein Oo, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-10-18 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: privilege-escalation, persistence, execution, stealth, T1574.001, G0032
// Tags: detection.emerging-threats
// Description: Detects sideloading of trojanized DLLs used in Lazarus APT campaign in the case of a Spanish
//   aerospace company
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://www.welivesecurity.com/en/eset-research/lazarus-luring-employees-trojanized-coding-challenges-case-spanish-aerospace-company/
//   - https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/lazarus-hackers-breach-aerospace-firm-with-new-lightlesscan-malware/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules-emerging-threats/2023/TA/Lazarus/image_load_apt_lazarus_side_load_activity.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, microsoft_xdr schema)

DeviceImageLoadEvents
| where (InitiatingProcessFolderPath =~ "C:\\ProgramShared\\PresentationHost.exe" and FolderPath =~ ":\\ProgramShared\\mscoree.dll") or (InitiatingProcessFolderPath =~ "C:\\ProgramData\\Adobe\\colorcpl.exe" and FolderPath =~ "C:\\ProgramData\\Adobe\\colorui.dll") or (InitiatingProcessFolderPath =~ "C:\\ProgramData\\Oracle\\Java\\fixmapi.exe" and FolderPath =~ "C:\\ProgramData\\Oracle\\Java\\mapistub.dll") or (InitiatingProcessFolderPath =~ "C:\\ProgramData\\Adobe\\ARM\\tabcal.exe" and FolderPath =~ "C:\\ProgramData\\Adobe\\ARM\\HID.dll")
